WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
Mr. Zhang, it’s not good.

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,240
The person below just reported

3
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,920
Vice President Chen was taken away by the law enforcement team again

4
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:06,160
They said they were taken away by the arm or something.

5
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,200
I was taken away by the law enforcement team again and asked if I had any questions.

6
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,800
Which law enforcement team made the arrangements this time?

7
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:11,880
You call the lawyer

8
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:12,920
Ask the lawyer to wait for me downstairs

9
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,630
Follow me now

10
00:00:14,630 --> 00:00:15,710
It's you who tells the truth

11
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:17,350
Or should we find a way to make you explain?

12
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:18,990
What do you tell Yang Jun?

13
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:21,270
Please explain how you killed Yang Jun, right?

14
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:23,700
It’s the bald old man who you guys detected.

15
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:26,060
When was his death?

16
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,020
Are you asking me or am I asking you?

17
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:29,260
How about we both switch?

18
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,540
You stand and I sit where you are

19
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,500
am i okay

20
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,340
You won't tell me the details of his death

21
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,660
How can I explain to you

22
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,740
Chen Yundong

23
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,180
You'd better be more honest with me

24
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,260
I made you run away last time because I had no evidence

25
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:42,940
And this time we have solid evidence

26
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,860
Prove that this matter has something to do with you

27
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,700
So I advise you to tell the truth.

28
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:49,340
This is good for you, you know?

29
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,660
I tell the truth

30
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:52,340
This is the right attitude, right?

31
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:55,700
How did you kill Yang Jun? You started remembering that you used a gun and shot him with a gun.

32
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:58,190
Stop, stop, stop, don’t forget Chen Yundong

33
00:00:58,190 --> 00:00:59,750
What's wrong with you playing with me?

34
00:00:59,750 --> 00:01:01,110
Am I not telling the truth?

35
00:01:01,110 --> 00:01:02,430
Do you think we are not senior sisters?

36
00:01:02,430 --> 00:01:04,750
Do you think we are idiots? I tell you.

37
00:01:04,750 --> 00:01:06,630
Yang Jun was stabbed to death with a knife

38
00:01:06,630 --> 00:01:08,950
You told me that you shot Chen Yundong with a gun

39
00:01:08,950 --> 00:01:09,950
I advise you again

40
00:01:09,950 --> 00:01:11,190
You'd better be honest with me

41
00:01:11,190 --> 00:01:12,790
Maybe I remembered the wrong line

42
00:01:12,790 --> 00:01:13,830
Stabbed to death with a knife

43
00:01:13,830 --> 00:01:15,350
You ask again

44
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:16,270
When were you where?

45
00:01:16,270 --> 00:01:17,470
Kill Yang Jun
